    },
    "Choose": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "选择"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose a session in the sidebar to read its conversation.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在侧栏中选择一个会话，阅读其对话内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose or enter a folder": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "选择或输入文件夹"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Claude Code, Antigravity, and Pi sessions move to the Trash; Codex and Kiro CLI sessions are permanently deleted.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude Code、Antigravity 和 Pi 会话将移到废纸篓；Codex 和 Kiro CLI 会话将被永久删除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Claude Code, Antigravity, and Pi sessions on this Mac move to the Trash. Codex and Kiro CLI sessions and all sessions on SSH hosts are permanently deleted.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本机的 Claude Code、Antigravity 和 Pi 会话将移到废纸篓。Codex、Kiro CLI 会话和 SSH 主机上的所有会话将被永久删除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Claude Code, Codex, Antigravity, Kiro CLI, and Pi sessions on the host are listed under it in the sidebar, and open over SSH. Use a Host alias from ~/.ssh/config or user@hostname. `ssh <host>` must work without a password prompt, and the host needs rsync. Antigravity also needs python3; deleting its sessions needs lsof. Install tmux on the remote host so sessions keep running when the connection drops or the tab closes; click the session to reattach. The app's bundled tmux is only for this Mac.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "主机上的 Claude Code、Codex、Antigravity、Kiro CLI 和 Pi 会话会列在侧栏中，并通过 SSH 打开。请使用 ~/.ssh/config 中的主机别名或 user@hostname。`ssh <host>` 必须能够免密连接，主机还需要 rsync。Antigravity 需要 python3；删除会话还需要 lsof。在远程主机上安装 tmux，可让会话在断线或关闭标签后继续运行；点击会话即可重新连接。应用内置的 tmux 仅适用于此 Mac。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
