          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Antigravity session database, associated folder, and annotations will move to the macOS Trash. This also removes its entry from Antigravity's local index.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Antigravity 会话数据库、关联文件夹和注释将移到 macOS 废纸篓，并从 Antigravity 本地索引中移除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Claude Code session file and its associated folder will move to the macOS Trash. This also removes its entry from Claude Code's local index.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude Code 会话文件及其关联文件夹将移到 macOS 废纸篓，并从 Claude Code 本地索引中移除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Pi session file and its associated folder will be permanently deleted on %@. SSH hosts have no Trash, so this cannot be undone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 上的 Pi 会话文件及其关联文件夹将被永久删除。SSH 主机没有废纸篓，此操作无法撤销。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Pi session file and its associated folder will move to the macOS Trash.": {
      "localizations": {
